{"id":"wb-8-724","name":"开远发电厂旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"开远发电厂","text":"开远发电厂位于中华人民共和国云南省红河哈尼族彝族自治州开远市灵泉街道市西南路者坡寨。开远发电厂是中国第一个五年计划时期苏联援建的156项重点工程之一，是云南省第一座半自动化燃煤凝汽式火力发电厂，始建于1955年，1965年全部建成，1998年停产。2019年10月，开远发电厂旧址被列入第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BC%80%E8%BF%9C%E5%8F%91%E7%94%B5%E5%8E%82","revisionId":92457991,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92457991","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/869ff7282543bf786660fa07.jpg","title":"开远发电厂旧址_2026-04-15_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%BC%80%E8%BF%9C%E5%8F%91%E7%94%B5%E5%8E%82%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80_2026-04-15_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ae/%E5%BC%80%E8%BF%9C%E5%8F%91%E7%94%B5%E5%8E%82%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80_2026-04-15_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Kcx36","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​开远发电厂旧址","width":320,"height":213}}